4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iDskmFUwO40Q7kNvwGv5OBV&_nc_oc=AdpsB-vKaWmiYlhiAU1glAa8dhSVXjzlIYZe8gfn6yulbDT92yM0fHhP9v0GVbNua9Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFuwmEUZj4lU_qwAa36lt1ccb3OgJas-NPjNcluICh6sg&oe=6A81B554"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=20Fc7j6bP0kQ7kNvwF-c6k5&_nc_oc=Adq_OZw6SqynkSInvNpTHmCy4UsT310D3pAQNRf4Jb4wupg_YNWXageogcbszWTmWBw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGiBb-_z2Q_qNkyxCIi9lIeFcS1Q2cLX_h8FPFw07qKxQ&oe=6A81BA32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lXQuow3aEHgQ7kNvwHZR40d&_nc_oc=AdrbaFLL54BO_EZfFtM0eW-c9e9X8YjIrc9ISydQsfK5aiU0dqfe8W0ek1m3Y4iDsPs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEmTL830r53nC5vajz9TN7Nkm2Pa6HhSHdJiUJz6A1pOQ&oe=6A818F95"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p